晉，南連齊、楚，北購於單于，其後乃可圖也。」太子曰：「太傅之計，曠日彌久，心惛然，恐不能須臾。且非獨於此也，夫樊將軍窮困於天下，歸身於丹，丹終不以迫於彊秦而棄所哀憐之交，置之匈奴，是固丹命卒之時也。願太傅更慮之。」鞠武曰：「夫行危欲求安，造禍而求福，計淺而怨深，連結一人之後交，不顧國家之大害，此所謂『資怨而助禍』矣。夫以鴻毛燎於爐炭之上，必無事矣。且以鵰鷙之秦，行怨暴之怒，豈足道哉！燕有田光先生，其爲人智深而勇沈，可與謀。」太子曰：「願因太傅而得交於田先生，可乎？」鞠武曰：「敬諾。」出見田先生，道「太子願圖國事於先生也」。田光曰：「敬奉教。」乃造焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"秦將樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"ye9_ftb_i0q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"fdc_ofl_z5f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_qe2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"鞠武","kind":"person","person_id":"1vh_24w_d7w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"fdc_ofl_z5f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ye9_ftb_i0q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"管、晏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱或擬議結盟對象未定，保留未解，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_qe2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"ye9_ftb_i0q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"單于","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱或擬議結盟對象未定，保留未解，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_q