e:m027-0366","start":366,"end":368,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_qe2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0373","start":373,"end":375,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"z0v_ish_b9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0378","start":378,"end":380,"surface":"田光","kind":"person","person_id":"z0v_ish_b9u","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p028","text":"太子逢迎，卻行爲導，跪而蔽席。田光坐定，左右無人，太子避席而請曰：「燕秦不兩立，願先生留意也。」田光曰：「臣聞騏驥盛壯之時，一日而馳千里；至其衰老，駑馬先之。今太子聞光盛壯之時，不知臣精已消亡矣。雖然，光不敢以圖國事，所善荊卿可使也。」太子曰：「願因先生得結交於荊卿，可乎？」田光曰：「敬諾。」即起，趨出。太子送至門，戒曰：「丹所報，先生所言者，國之大事也，願先生勿泄也！」田光俛而笑曰：「諾。」僂行見荊卿，曰：「光與子相善，燕國莫不知。今太子聞光壯盛之時，不知吾形已不逮也，幸而教之曰『燕秦不兩立，願先生留意也』。光竊不自外，言足下於太子也，願足下過太子於宮。」荊軻曰：「謹奉教。」田光曰：「吾聞之，長者爲行，不使人疑之。今太子告光曰：『所言者，國之大事也，願先生勿泄』，是太子疑光也。夫爲行而使人疑之，非節俠也。」欲自殺以激荊卿，曰：「願足下急過太子，言光已死，明不言也。」因遂自刎而死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_qe2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"田光","kind":"person","person_id":"z0v_ish_b9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱或擬議結盟對象未定，保留未解，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"v89_58y_qe2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"z0v_ish_b9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"田光","kind":"person","person_id":"z0v_ish_b9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m028-0080","st